    title "Profitable Business Ideas for the Next 10 Years | Crypto, Blockchain"
    description "In this video, we're going to talk about business ideas on web 3.0 that have a good chance of taking over the world in the next 10 years. We're going to look at different markets and how they're currently being transformed with the help of blockchain.&#10;&#10;106 million people are now using cryptocurrencies around the world - https://markets.businessinsider.com/news/currencies/crypto-users-pass-100-million-boomers-gen-x-bitcoin-btc-ethereum-2021-2&#10;46 Million Americans Now Own Bitcoin - https://www.newsweek.com/46-million-americans-now-own-bitcoin-crypto-goes-mainstream-1590639&#10;13% of Americans traded crypto in the past year. By comparison, 24% of Americans invested in stocks over the same time period - https://www.cnbc.com/2021/07/23/13percent-of-americans-traded-crypto-in-the-past-year-survey-finds.html&#10;Institutional Investors Now Hold $70B Of Bitcoin - https://finance.yahoo.com/news/institutional-investors-now-hold-70b-122022840.html&#10;&#10;Timestamps:&#10;00:00 Crypto is taking over the world&#10;01:59 What is a smart contract&#10;03:40 What is web 3.0&#10;06:07 Why now is the best time to start&#10;07:00 Real estate&#10;08:09 Creator economy&#10;11:47 ID and elections&#10;14:44 Healthcare, education, banking&#10;&#10;&#10;Subscribe to my substack: https://marinamogilko.substack.com/ &#10;&#10;I post daily stories about my life and business routine on my Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/linguamarina/&#10;&#10;&#11088; ENROLL IN MY YOUTUBE COURSE - https://bit.ly/3dQuMId&#10;&#11088; DOWNLOAD MY ENGLISH WORKBOOK - https://marinamogilko.co/workbook&#10;&#10;&#128176; INVESTMENT APPS &#38; BOOKS:&#10;- BlockFi - https://blockfi.com/?ref=5cc7c2c0  (I keep 1% of my portfolio here (9% interest rate)&#10;- CoinBase - https://www.coinbase.com/join/mogilk_1?src=ios-link&#10;- Binance - https://accounts.binance.us/en/register?ref=57910459&#10;- Webull - https://act.webull.com/i/ov8wp37ijU84/fwn/&#10;- Robinhood - https://join.robinhood