    title "Blockchain Technology - Audio Article"
    description "Over the past few years, you have consistently heard the term ' Blockchain technology' probably regarding cryptocurrencies. Blockchain is an emerging technology. Keeping this in mind we are presenting an audio article on this topic. Drishti IAS has taken an initiative to provide the best material to Civil Services Aspirants. This information will help you to make a better understanding without any coaching. Inputs are taken from reputed English Newspapers e.g. The Hindu and the Indian Express as well as team Drishti inputs are also included.&#10;&#10;&#2346;&#2367;&#2331;&#2354;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2354;&#2379;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2348;&#2381;&#2354;&#2377;&#2325;&#2330;&#2375;&#2344; &#2340;&#2325;&#2344;&#2368;&#2325; &#2325;&#2366; &#2344;&#2366;&#2350; &#2310;&#2346;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2312; &#2348;&#2366;&#2352; &#2360;&#2369;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;&#2404; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2369;&#2326; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2348;&#2367;&#2335;&#2325;&#2377;&#2311;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404; &#2348;&#2381;&#2354;&#2377;&#2325;&#2330;&#2375;&#2344; &#2319;&#2325; &#2313;&#2349;&#2352;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2369;&#2312; &#2340;&#2325;&#2344;&#2368;&#2325; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2311;&#2360;&#2375; &#2343;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2352;&#2326;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2369;&#2319; &#2361;&#2350; &#2311;&#2360; &#2350;&#2369;&#2342;&#2381;&#2342;&#2375; &#2346;&#2352; &#2319;&#2325; &#2321;&#2337;&#2367;&#2351;&#2379; &#2310;&#2352;&#2381;&#2335;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354; &#2346;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2352; &#2352;&#2361;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;  &#2342;&#2371;&#2359;&#2381;&#2335;&#2367; &#2310;&#2312;&#2319;&#2319;&#2360; &#2344;&#2375; &#2360;&#2367;&#2357;&#2367;&#2354; &#2360;&#2375;&#2357;&#2366; &#2313;&#2350;&#2381;&#2350;&#2368;&#2342;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2352;&#238