    description "Subscribe to our YouTube channel for free here: &#10;https://sc.mp/subscribe-youtube&#10;&#10;Since Xi Jinping called it a core technology in 2019, blockchain has been driving change across China's ports, cities, and grasslands.&#10;&#10;Forkast.News with support from the Judith Neilson Institute&#8217;s Asian Stories project explores how blockchain and China&#8217;s  Blockchain-based Service Network is defining today how it could be used tomorrow.&#10;&#10;Support us:&#10;https://subscribe.scmp.com&#10;&#10;Follow us on:&#10;Website:  https://www.scmp.com&#10;Facebook:  https://facebook.com/scmp&#10;Twitter:  https://twitter.com/scmpnews&#10;Instagram:  https://instagram.com/scmpnews&#10;Linkedin:  https://www.linkedin.com/company/south-china-morning-post/&#10;&#10;#scmp #Technology #Blockchain"
