    title "Blockchain in Supply Chain | Soumya Choudhury | TEDxIIMBangalore"
    description "Mr. Soumya Choudhury shares his thoughts on how blockchain can be used to bring efficiency in supply chain and how the has 24 years of experience in Management Consulting/ Mergers &#38; Acquisition with IBM, Sona Koyo, Merril among others. He co-founded Visilogix, offering supply chain solutions &#38; consulting services to various industries. He is an IIT-Bombay and IIM-Ahmedabad alumnus. Soumya Choudhury has 24 years of corporate experience in Management Consulting (AFF), Investment Banking/M&#38;A (Merrill, Dresdner, KPMG), Automotive Industry (Sona Koyo Steering) and the last decade in Information Technology in Application Development &#38; Maintenance Sales in the Large Deals team for IBM.&#10;In his latest stint, Soumya has his own startup Visilogix offering supply chain solutions and consulting services to industry verticals in FMCG, Retail, and eCommerce.  Soumya is also an Adjunct Professor of Supply Chain and Digital Business at IFIM Business School, Bangalore. He is an alumnus of IIM-Ahmedabad and IIT-Bombay. This talk was given at a TEDx event using the TED conference format but independently organized by a local community. Learn more at https://www.ted.com/tedx"
