    description "In this video, I talk with Abhishek Bisht about blockchain development and how one can become a blockchain developer. He talks about Ethereum and Solana platforms and its applications. There are thousands of applications being created at this second on the blockchain and the field is attracting funding from tons of VCs.&#10;&#10;According to https://remoteok.com/remote-blockchain-jobs the average salary of a remote blockchain developer is over $100K/year.&#10;&#10;&#128248; Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/ishansharma7390&#10;&#10;Join MarkitUpX Discord Server: https://discord.gg/SqzaqqydhN&#10;&#10;You can connect with Abhishek here:&#10;YouTube: https://youtu.be/7c_DVu3NB8s&#10;Instagram: https://instagram.com/iam_ab4&#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/abhibisht97&#10;&#10;Start Investing in Crypto with WazirX: https://wazirx.com/invite/874huam9&#10;&#10;Timestamps&#10;0:00 Teaser&#10;0:15 Video starts&#10;0:41 Why blockchain development is gaining traction?&#10;2:30 How to start blockchain development?&#10;5:30 What is Solana and Ethereum and what are its applications?&#10;10:50 What opportunities are available for developers: freelance work or full time?&#10;12:20 How to get opportunities for blockchain developer roles?&#10;13:40 Is the crypto field in a giant bubble?&#10;17:07 comment &#34;I watched till the end!&#34;&#10;&#10;&#128073;Remote Software Developer Jobs: https://youtu.be/dVoq5vjNI1Y&#10;&#128073;Software Development vs Competitive Coding: https://youtu.be/QBI8mQZWGxE&#10;&#128073;FAANG vs Remote Startup Job: https://youtu.be/HbZK-tNHXW4&#10;&#128073;Best Free Coding Courses: https://youtu.be/zaGwW2vNHlw&#10;&#128073;Real Software Engineer Salary: https://youtu.be/kk-nOnMnvaU&#10;&#10;&#128073;How to Get Paid Internships: https://youtu.be/E6tSjmnbGwU&#10;&#10;&#128073;7 Ways I Make Money as a 19 Year Old: https://youtu.be/U0CiBPZl9-o&#10;&#10;&#128073;15 Ways to Make Money in College: https://youtu.be/bLx5sXZx1hY&#10;&#10;&#128073