    date "2022-03-22T15:59:17Z"
    title "Ahmed Yousif on integrating Middle East governments with blockchain | CG Backstage"
    description "The #MiddleEast is leading the world when it comes to integrating blockchain into the public sector, with most governments already working with the technology in some capacity. The #BSVblockchain is making great headway in the region, and as Ahmed Yousif, the man leading the charge in the Middle East for BSV tells #CGBackstage reporter Becky Liggero, he&#8217;s just getting started.&#10; &#10;&#9658; Hit #Subscribe &#38; #HitTheBell so you don't miss out on any new videos!&#10;&#10;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;&#9658; Our Links:&#10;Facebook   &#9658; https://www.facebook.com/realcoingeek/&#10;Twitter      &#9658; https://twitter.com/realcoingeek&#10;Instagram &#9658; https://www.instagram.com/coingeek_official/&#10;LinkedIn      &#9658; https://www.linkedin.com/company/coingeek&#10;Telegram  &#9658; https://t.me/RealCoinGeekDiscussion&#10;Web          &#9658; https://coingeek.com&#10;&#10;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#10;CoinGeek is the authority on blockchain technology, with a focus on the original #Bitcoin, Bitcoin Satoshi Vision (BSV).&#10; &#10;CoinGeek provides you timely news on the latest developments in the industry and features the brightest and most creative minds in the community to give you the best insights on the current state and direction of the technology."
