    description "How To Become A Blockchain Developer? | Various Skills Explained | Malayalam&#10;&#10;This video focus on the one of the most demanding technology and how to become a part of this technology.&#10;&#10;The topics covered in this video are as follows&#10;&#10; &#8259; What is blockchain technology?&#10; &#8259; Who is a blockchain developer?&#10; &#8259; Types of blockchain developers?&#10;        &#8259; Core blockchain developer&#10;        &#8259; Blockchain software developer&#10; &#8259; Roles of core blockchain developer&#10; &#8259; Roles of Blockchain software developer&#10; &#8259; The skills to become a block chain dev?&#10;        &#8259; Understanding of blockchain technology&#10;        &#8259; Understanding of data structures such as linked Lists, Stacks, hashing binary trees etc&#10;        &#8259; Cryptography&#10;        &#8259; Smart contracts development&#10;        &#8259; understanding languages such as Solidity, Viper, Chaincode&#10;        &#8259; Web development skills&#10;        &#8259; understanding of Object oriented Programming concepts&#10;        &#8259; knowledge of Java, JS, C, C++, Python etc&#10;&#10;Watch now.&#10;&#10;#m2powerfuture &#10;#mpowerfuture #mpower&#10;#aneeshkumar&#10;#aktalks #malayalam &#10;&#10;#blockchainmalayalam #blockchaintechnology #blockchain #bitcoinmalayalam #blockchainwallet&#10; #blockchainapps #blockchaindeveloper #blockchaindevelopment #skillsforblockchain&#10;#malayalam&#10;&#10;Language : Malayalam&#10;&#10;Social Media Links:&#10;&#10;Instagram : https://www.instagram.com/m2power.futurz/&#10;Facebook : https://www.facebook.com/m2powerfuture&#10;Twitter : https://twitter.com/MpowerFuture &#10;&#10;Image Credits : Google&#10;&#10;Editing credits : https://instagram.com/an_art_life"
