    description "Kodak announced its new blockchain-based document management system at a two-day conference in Rochester, New York. The platform will enable businesses and governments to store and manage sensitive documents. According to company Kodak Document Management Platform leverages Blockchain to provide efficiency and security.&#10;&#10;For more updates on courses and tips follow us on:&#10;- Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/blockchaincouncil&#10;- Twitter: https://twitter.com/ChainCouncil &#10;- LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/company/blockchaincouncil&#10;&#10;Sources&#10;&#10;YouTube&#10;==========================&#10;1. Cheshire Audio Visual&#10;Link: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8n2_AMg9c80&#10;&#10;&#10;Images&#10;=========================&#10;1. cointelegraph.com&#10;Link: https://cointelegraph.com/news/kodak-reveals-new-blockchain-based-document-management-system&#10;Link: https://cointelegraph.com/news/kodakone-blockchain-beta-test-sees-1-mln-in-content-licensing-claims&#10;&#10;2. forbes.com&#10;Link: https://www.forbes.com/sites/billybambrough/2018/07/17/blow-for-bitcoin-as-kodak-mining-scheme-collapses-but-the-bitcoin-price-holds/#6f1d7ca36724&#10;&#10;3. btcmanager.com&#10;Link: https://btcmanager.com/amid-ico-crackdowns-kodak-announces-50-million-public-sale-of-native-token/?q=/amid-ico-crackdowns-kodak-announces-50-million-public-sale-of-native-token/&#38;&#10;&#10;4. twitter.com/kodakprint&#10;Link: https://twitter.com/kodakprint&#10;&#10;5. lunardigitalassets.com&#10;Link: https://lunardigitalassets.com/insights/interview/interview-kodakone-kodak-capitalizing-crypto-hype/&#10;&#10;6. blockonomi.com&#10;Link: https://blockonomi.com/kodak-coin-guide/&#10;&#10;7. petapixel.com&#10;Link: https://petapixel.com/2018/01/10/kodak-stock-shoots-300-thanks-cryptomania/&#10;&#10;8. blogcentral.rmit.edu.au&#10;Link: http://www.blogcentral.rmit.edu.au/2018/01/"
