    title "By 2030, 15% of global population will use blockchain says venture capitalist  Vineet Budki"
    description "Vineet Budki, venture capitalist and CEO of Cypher Capital gives a timeline for when 10% to 15% of the world&#8217;s population will be on blockchain in some capacity, and discusses what&#8217;s needed to get there with David Lin, anchor for Kitco News at the Paris Blockchain Summit. &#10;&#10;Sponsored by Okra Finance - Permissioned DeFi Composable Index and Execution Platform&#10;For more information visit: &#10;Website: https://okra.finance&#10;Twitter: @okra_finance&#10;LinkedIn: Okra-Finance&#10;&#10;Follow David Lin on Twitter: @davidlin_TV (https://twitter.com/davidlin_TV)&#10;Follow Kitco News on Twitter: @KitcoNewsNOW (https://twitter.com/KitcoNewsNOW)&#10;Follow Cypher Capital on Twitter: @cypher_capital (https://twitter.com/cypher_capital)&#10;&#10;0:00 - Cypher Capital&#10;3:54 - Major crypto trends &#10;5:30 - Bitcoin adoption&#10;8:14 - Investment criteria &#10;9:19 - Banking with cryptos&#10;10:30 - 1 billion crypto users  &#10;12:00 - Transacting with Bitcoin &#10;12:56 - 15% of world population will use blockchain&#10;&#10;#Bitcoin #blobkchain #crypto &#10;__________________________________________________________________&#10;Kitco News is the world&#8217;s #1 source of metals market information. Our videos feature interviews with prominent industry figures to bring you market-affecting insights, with the goal of helping people make informed investment decisions. &#10;&#10;Subscribe to our channel to stay up to date on the latest insights moving the metals markets. &#10;&#10;For more breaking news, visit http://www.kitco.com/&#10;&#10;Follow us on social media: &#10;Facebook - https://www.facebook.com/KitcoNews/?ref=br_rs &#10;Twitter - https://twitter.com/kitconewsnow&#10;StockTwits - https://stocktwits.com/kitconews&#10;&#10;Live gold price and charts: http://www.kitco.com/gold-price-today-usa/&#10;Live silver price and charts: http://www.kitco.com/silver-price-today-usa/&#10;&#10;Don&#8217;t forget to sign up for Kitco News&#8217